            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<ul><li><h4>Sustainably Sourced & Developed<\/h4><\/li><li><h4>Artisanal & Ancestral Craftsmanship<\/h4><\/li><li><h4>Exquisite Hand Detailing<\/h4><\/li><li><h4>Alluring yet Attainable<\/h4><\/li><li><h4>Seductive & Bold, Redefining Mystique<\/h4><\/li><\/ul>",
